# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-07
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**New skills for agents** &mdash; Whether you are migrating to the new client-side Sampler and Estimator, or migrating old notebooks that still use V1 primitives, the migrate-qiskit-ibm-runtime skill in the [Qiskit/skills](https://github.com/Qiskit/skills) repository can simplify the task. This new open-source repository contains official, IBM-verified agent skills for building IBM Quantum and Qiskit workflows. We will be adding more skills to this repository in the near future.\n"
msgstr "**Mga bagong skill para sa mga agent** &mdash; Maging ikaw ay nagma-migrate sa bagong client-side na Sampler at Estimator, o nagma-migrate ng mga lumang notebook na gumagamit pa ng V1 primitives, mapapadali ng skill na migrate-qiskit-ibm-runtime sa repository na [Qiskit/skills](https://github.com/Qiskit/skills) ang gawain. Naglalaman ang bagong open-source na repository na ito ng mga opisyal at IBM-verified na agent skill para sa pagbuo ng mga workflow ng IBM Quantum at Qiskit. Magdaragdag kami ng higit pang skill sa repository na ito sa malapit na hinaharap.\n"
